<title>POLAND: Polish Mieszko to enter bourse June 17.</title>
<headline>Polish Mieszko to enter bourse June 17.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish confectioner Mieszko SA will start trade on the Warsaw bourse's parallel market on June 17, the bourse's president said on Friday.</p>
<p>Mieszko's April 1.5-million-share initial public offering was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
